  "source_scope_note": "The selected problem is original Theorem4.17 only: the exact stable graded harmonic multiplicity formula for the specified cyclic GL/Vinberg pair in terms of distinguished tableaux and the original lambda_i(T) statistic. Complete author Sections1--4 retain every stable branching/invariant setup, new cyclic Littlewood-Richardson crystal dominance/separation construction, explicit unique least-weight/partition-tuple bijection and final cancellation. One exact original publisher quiver diagram is retained as a diagram-only asset; all surrounding representation formulas, captions and proof text are editable native author TeX. Literal source note: the third displayed line435 of the final separation proof has a product inside its exponent, while the preceding full sum-of-sizes434, additive lambda_i lemma414--424 and following separated factorization436 remain explicitly authored. Every original line is preserved; the isolated product-exponent line is not selected as an independent identity and no missing plus is inserted. This is the bounded root-cleared source-context disposition, not an editor proof or theorem-correctness certification.",
